        <mxCell id="jestnote" value="Use it when a custom route or workflow has logic worth testing, e.g. a future src/api/store/* route with real behavior. The only custom store route today is the /store/custom stub.&lt;br/&gt;Don't use it for the cart contract: it starts with no seed data, so the catalog fixtures would have to be rebuilt." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
